  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "iIilYOo47lWbnGhMhQt9A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 557.4572986757878,
      "y": 2720.8504082821155,
      "width": 1428.4437255859375,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1486975578,
      "version": 792,
      "versionNonce": 1085139162,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790083627529,
      "created": 1790067594298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. The system SHALL allow the users to place an order if available\n2. The system SHALL allow the user to cancel an order\n3. The system SHALL ensure that no order unit is processed twice (idempotency)\n4. The system SHALL allocate the order to the nearby robot to collect it\n5. The system SHALL track the real time progress of order lifecycle\n6. The system SALL notifies operators on important failures\n7. The System SHALL allow the customers to track their orders",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. The system SHALL allow the users to place an order if available\n2. The system SHALL allow the user to cancel an order\n3. The system SHALL ensure that no order unit is processed twice (idempotency)\n4. The system SHALL allocate the order to the nearby robot to collect it\n5. The system SHALL track the real time progress of order lifecycle\n6. The system SALL notifies operators on important failures\n7. The System SHALL allow the customers to track their orders",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OcENDA6Tx-WnAjlDV9ZsE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 535.6815379229022,
      "y": 3162.398867565559,
      "width": 1817.1715087890625,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1689550022,
      "version": 1068,
      "versionNonce": 113188890,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790083747862,
      "created": 1790068287311,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n1. The system should auto scale on hot seasons (not only for servers, but also request more robots)  \n2. The System SHALL allow the user to create order in low latency (<500ms)\n3. The System SHALL ensure data consistency through all product state transition\n4. The System SHALL find the the proper robot for the task in low latency (< 1s)\n5. The System SHALL add logging and observability to quickly identify issues\n6. The System SHALL target availability around 99% throughout the year\n7. The system SHALL be graceful to failures, preventing one component failure to block the lifecycle",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n1. The system should auto scale on hot seasons (not only for servers, but also request more robots)  \n2. The System SHALL allow the user to create order in low latency (<500ms)\n3. The System SHALL ensure data consistency through all product state transition\n4. The System SHALL find the the proper robot for the task in low latency (< 1s)\n5. The System SHALL add logging and observability to quickly identify issues\n6. The System SHALL target availability around 99% throughout the year\n7. The system SHALL be graceful to failures, preventing one component failure to block the lifecycle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Z8C1NrFvgq99pj9kqJOcT",
      "type": "text",
